OL,3,GNEWSAExpansion plans lodged for
OL,4,Alandmark theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major extension and
OL,7,Frefurbishment of Theatre Royal
OL,8,FWakefield have been submitted to the
OL,9,Fcouncil.
OL,11,FThe proposals aim to modernise the
OL,12,FGrade II* listed venue while protecting
OL,13,Fits historic character and improving
OL,14,Faccessibility.
OL,16,FChanges would include a new
OL,17,Fsecond-floor extension, upgraded
OL,18,Faudience facilities and improvements to
OL,19,Fthe auditorium.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
